OL,3,GNEWSARail services disrupted by
OL,4,Aelectricity fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services between Eastleigh and
OL,7,FFareham are being disrupted due to
OL,8,Felectrical supply problems.
OL,10,FAn earlier fault halted services via
OL,11,FBotley on South Western Railway (SWR),
OL,12,Fwith trains diverting to St Denys.
OL,14,FSWR said all lines had since reopened
OL,15,Fwith travellers urged to check their
OL,16,Fjourney with delays expected until
OL,17,Fabout 14:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
