OL,3,GNEWSARail services disrupted by
OL,4,Aelectricity fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe train operator said London Waterloo
OL,7,Fto Portsmouth Harbour via Eastleigh
OL,8,Fservices were expected to run as booked
OL,9,Fin both directions, but there could be
OL,10,Fdelays and short-notice changes as
OL,11,Fservices return to normal.
